description:
Formula Rossa at Ferrari World in Abu Dhabi is one of the world's fastest roller coasters, launching riders from 0 to 149 mph.  This Intamin accelerator coaster uses a hydraulic launch to blast riders out into the desert over a series of airtime hills and turns.  This ride held the speed record from 2010-2025.

